    {
      "source": "On the server side the map can be populated initially through a\n<a href=\"../../server/HandshakeInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeInterceptor</code></a>. On the client side the map can be populated via\n<a href=\"../../client/WebSocketClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.client\"><code>WebSocketClient</code></a> handshake methods.",
      "translation": "在服务器端，映射可以通过 <a href=\"../../server/HandshakeInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeInterceptor</code></a> 进行初始填充。在客户端，映射可以通过 <a href=\"../../client/WebSocketClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.client\"><code>WebSocketClient</code></a> 的握手方法进行填充。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The underlying standard WebSocket session (JSR-356) does\nnot allow concurrent sending. Therefore, sending must be synchronized. To ensure\nthat, one option is to wrap the <code>WebSocketSession</code> with the\n<a href=\"../../handler/ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 底层的标准 WebSocket 会话（JSR-356）不允许并发发送。因此，必须对发送操作进行同步。为了确保这一点，一种选择是使用 <a href=\"../../handler/ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a> 包装 <code>WebSocketSession</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides processing of incoming SockJS message frames and delegates lifecycle\nevents and messages to the (application) <a href=\"../../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供传入的 SockJS 消息帧的处理，并将生命周期事件和消息委托给（应用程序）<a href=\"../../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses implement actual send as well as disconnect logic.",
      "translation": "子类实现实际的发送以及断开连接逻辑。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
